title: Read from Jeff's side with 'C-c v o', Top's note shows none of the 32.
pid: dac22eae-1a65-4523-9347-0a97e246392c
body: |2-
  Steps: view Top's 'to Jeff', then 'override-perspective SIDECAR
  jeff-public'. The root becomes Jeff's fork: 'maybe done' and nothing
  else, 29 headlines, no subscribee folder and no count. It is the
  gap Top already named in the 06:25 message, "Its other folders are
  still the old root's", which Top offered to have built unasked. It
  matters to Top, who would read Jeff's side this way; it is Sue's
  (overrides) with Drew (drawing), by the team note.
